  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Touch Me I'm Going to Scream Pt. 1**: back after 24 archived shows (902 days) [3]\n- **Holdin on to Black Metal**: back after 23 archived shows (807 days) [3]\n- **Aluminum Park**: back after 25 archived shows (904 days) [3]\n- **Strangulation**: back after 33 archived shows (1031 days) [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2015-06-21.CA-11.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 136 min [1]\n- **mmj2015-06-21.CA-11.flac16**: source not stated; 21 songs; 136 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Taper sat in the balcony, row W, on the center aisle, with mics about eight feet high [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2015-06-21.CA-11.flac24**: taped by bersey; transferred by bersey; source: CA-11 > CA-9100 > Sony PCM-M10 [1]. Also: Recorded with CA-11 cardioid mics into a CA-9100 preamp and a Sony PCM-M10 at 24-bit/48kHz; Transfer went from recorder to PC, edited in Sound Forge and CD Wave Editor, encoded to FLAC level 6 with Trader's Little Helper, tagged in foobar2000 [1]\n- **mmj2015-06-21.CA-11.flac16**: taped by bersey; transferred by bersey; source: CA-11 > CA-9100 > Sony PCM-M10 [2]",
